{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54300","headline":"颂 四 · 克符道者","name":"颂 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人境俱不夺，思量意不偏。\n主宾言不（《五灯会元》作「少」）异，问答理俱全。\n踏破澄潭月，穿开碧落天。\n不能明妙用，沦溺在无缘。\n（《天圣广灯录》卷十三、《五灯会元》卷十一、《人天眼目》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"克符道者","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54300.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54300","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}